OL,3,GNEWSAWe came from Brazil to Derby for
OL,4,ATomb Raider Day
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was walking around the city and I
OL,7,Fspoke to two elderly ladies - they were
OL,8,Fso surprised we came all the way from
OL,9,FBrazil for Lara Croft."
OL,11,FHenrique Coppola and his husband Diego
OL,12,Fare among hundreds of people who have
OL,13,Ftravelled from all over the world to
OL,14,FDerby for the city's sixth Tomb Raider
OL,15,FDay.
OL,17,FCreated in 2021 by Derby-born Tomb
OL,18,FRaider fan Luke Earle, the event brings
OL,19,Ftogether fans of the franchise to
OL,20,Fcelebrate all things Lara Croft-related
OL,21,Fin the city where the character was
OL,22,Fcreated 30 years ago.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
